WEBVTT

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:17.360
Unpredictable attacks that come from his unheard of actions...

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:21.800
A wild boy who moves only
on intuition and reflexes...

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:26.960
His mindless style means his movement
patterns are exceptionally difficult to read.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:32.100
At least I have plenty
of data on Takao Kinomiya.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:37.470
The target will have to
be this irrational kid.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:42.770
Where are the other two?

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:56.940
Pierce Hedgehog...

00:02:58.180 --> 00:02:59.850
Matilda!

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.100
I've been looking for you.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.850
We need to head back.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:12.600
I know! This is what we
have to do to win.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:16.170
That's what we've been telling
ourselves to get this far.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:21.620
To win the world championships.
Only for that!

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.130
All for victory!

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.980
--All for victory!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.560
For victory!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.100
--For victory!

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.980
With my Bey...

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:42.020
There's no
other way around it.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:45.760
This is what we
have to do to win.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.120
Let's head back.
The team's waiting for us.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.970
In conclusion, the hidden
blades in Mihael's Beyblade

00:03:55.970 --> 00:04:00.010
can be used to freely
extend its reach.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:06.020
The best countermeasure is to keep
your distance and wait for an opening.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.260
So in short...

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.480
Yeah, whatever!

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:13.240
Who cares about weak points!
Just use your gut!

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:18.380
You say that, but not even
Rei could avoid his attacks!

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.300
We can't take this lightly!

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:26.720
I could create a better game plan
if we had more accurate data!

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:31.700
What a pain! We could end all this now if we just went to Daitenji...

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:32.900
No.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.100
Absolutely not.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.580
Why are you so against it?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:42.290
We have to beat them.
That's the only way!

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:43.880
But why--

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.720
Just because!

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.810
Sucks for you, hag--

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.940
We will win!

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.250
Are you awake now?!

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:08.020
How dare you show up late on the final match of the Spanish stage!

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.640
You're a bad
example to the team!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:16.090
I'll have to punish you again.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:19.180
Stop, Coach! It was me who--

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:24.320
I'm sorry! As the captain,
I'm responsible!

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:27.120
You're damn right
you're responsible!

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:32.240
No matter. I'll be sure to punish you plenty after the match.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.770
Line up!

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:43.180
The BBA Revolution and the world
champion Takao Kinomiya. Neo-Borg.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:48.560
If we defeat these two teams, the Barthez name will be set.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:53.500
We will rise to the highest
level of popularity and skill!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.940
You will win!
I will make it so!

00:05:56.940 --> 00:06:02.690
I've prepared everything!
You simply need to follow my orders!

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:07.060
In the end, Barthez will win!
Barthez Soldat!

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:09.010
--Yes, Coach Barthez!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.820
Everything for victory!

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.880
--Everything for victory!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.680
The final match of the Spanish
stage is about to begin!

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:20.800
BBA Revolution VS Barthez Soldat!

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:25.620
Both teams have one win and one loss
each and are the talk of the town!

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:30.400
This is the stadium these
warriors will face off in!

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:39.290
These numerous walls will obstruct
the view of their Beyblades!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:44.590
The Bladers will have to battle
while keeping an eye on both Beys!

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:50.180
Its appearance resembles that of a
labyrinth with a Minotaur sealed inside it!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.820
Its name is...

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:54.490
The Knossos Stadium!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.690
What a weird stadium...

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:07.040
Lose sight of your opponent and you
could be at a huge disadvantage!

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:11.530
Who cares about some dumb walls? That won't work on me!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.340
Yeah, none of that matters!

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:29.220
What's the matter, Matilda?

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:34.500
Pull yourself together.
You have a very important duty to fulfill.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.780
Yes, coach!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:42.460
The first battle!
Daichi VS Matilda!

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:45.810
Three! Two! One!

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.650
Go, Shoot!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.080
Go, Pierce Hedgehog!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:12.060
Uh-oh! Matilda's high speed attacks don't seem
to be working on Daichi's Gaia Dragoon!

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:16.580
She takes evasive action
behind the walls!

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:18.980
Get back here!

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:26.520
Amazing!
Daichi flushed Matilda out!

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.540
Chalk one up to
his wild instincts!

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:32.660
I played a lot of hide-and-seek
back in the mountains!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:37.170
Great job, Daichi! You can finish
her off in one fell swoop!

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:40.930
Barthez wouldn't
let it end like this.

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.440
I know he's up to something.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.370
Be careful, Daichi!

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.720
Mission B. Standby.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.810
Yes, Coach Barthez.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.980
You know it's useless!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:07.050
Burst Hurricane!

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.170
Pierce Hedgehog...

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:38.220
Oh my god! Gaia Dragoon has
completely scrapped Pierce Hedgehog!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:43.130
But the sheer destructive force
has spelled its own doom!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:54.850
My...
Gaia Dragoon...

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.860
What happened?

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:03.440
I theorize that her Bey was
modified to be easily destructible.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:07.660
Easily...? Why would you do
that to your own Bey?

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:10.490
To damage Daichi's Bey!

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:15.130
With damage like that, he couldn't
possibly fight in a third battle.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:19.940
So we'll be disqualified if we
don't win the second battle!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.940
That's crazy!

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:27.690
Though it means they must be confident they can win the second battle...

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.100
They'd go that far?!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.170
Why you--!

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:36.260
How dare you pull that
stunt on my Gaia Dragoon!

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.650
Whatever could you mean?

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:41.130
You...!

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:46.860
Knock it off, Daichi!

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:49.520
Let me go, Takao!
Let me go!

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:53.570
He wrecked my
Gaia Dragoon!

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.970
Avenge one Beyblade
with another!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.400
Don't you want to be
the world champion?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.040
Hey!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:04.840
Let me go!
Let me go!

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:08.200
Pierce Hedgehog...
I'm sorry...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.020
I'm so sorry...!

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:15.130
Fight to win.
For the team. For my friends.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:20.220
That's what I believed!
But is that really true?

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.950
Doing all this...

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.780
Mihael...

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.400
Time for the second battle.

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:35.360
Now the BBA Revolution will
automatically lose the third battle.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:39.800
All that's left is to cook
Takao Kinomiya like an egg!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:43.600
Damn! How dare you do
that to my Gaia Dragoon!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:45.740
--Damn! Damn!
--I can't watch this anymore.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:48.820
We need to tell
Chairman Daitenji!

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:54.460
I agree! Beys are precious
partners to all Bladers!

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:56.240
To use them as
deadly weapons is--

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.500
Out of the question!

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:03.860
What do you mean? Think about how Daichi
feels after getting his Beyblade wrecked!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.460
That's my point.

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:10.060
Reporting them won't
really mean we've won!

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:22.850
To him, Beybattles are
just games to win!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:28.980
Beys are tools. Bladers are his pawns.
That's why he can fight dirty!

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:42.050
He's mocking Beybattles!
He's making fun of them!

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:49.940
So I won't be satisfied until I show him
what a real Beyspirit is made of!

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:51.660
Takao...

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.380
So let me fight! Please!

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:59.200
Get on out there, Takao.

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:00.740
Hitoshi!

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:05.600
You better win, you hear me?!
And it can't be a normal win...

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:10.810
It's gotta be, uhh... A super win!
Otherwise there'll be hell to pay!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.180
Yeah.
I'll take care of it.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.940
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.940
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:26.610
It's time for
the second battle.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:32.280
While the BBA team gained an
amazing win in the first battle,

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:37.520
Daichi Sumeragi's Bey is
unfit to fight a third battle.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:41.080
So each team has their
backs against the wall!

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:44.420
Everything rides on
the second battle!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.760
Will the BBA win and
end the match here?

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:53.490
Or will Mihael's Bey,
Death Gargoyle, turn the tables?!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:57.230
I'll show you my
awesome Beyspirit!

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.170
We can't lose!
We just can't!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.250
Three! Two! One!

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:05.700
Go, Shoot!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:13.360
With that annoying monkey gone, there's nothing left to fear!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:17.020
I've got plenty of
data on Takao Kinomiya.

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:20.580
I'll give you a nice taste...

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:24.240
Of the missions
I devised myself!

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.620
I won't lose!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.940
Move to area B.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.130
Yes, Coach.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:47.140
Mission G! Now!

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:48.850
Yes, Coach.

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:04.040
Mihael unleashes a powerful assault!
Have the tables turned?!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:07.090
Darn it! What are you
doing out there, Takao?!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:11.400
It's time for you to
learn that this is reality!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.140
Crap!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:22.120
Friendship? Teamwork?
Those are words spouted by losers!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:26.130
Victory goes to the avid!
All you need is data and strategy!

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:32.440
The ends always justifies the means!
The victor is always righteous!

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:34.600
And the victor
will be Barthez!

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:38.420
Go, Mihael! Mission G!

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:42.140
The two Beys have
entered the deadly maze!

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:55.800
Dragoon!

00:15:56.120 --> 00:16:00.440
Look at that power! The walls of the labyrinth have crumbled!

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:06.770
And Dragoon is buried under
a pile of debris! Mihael wins!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.940
It's all over.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:19.610
Sorry, Kinomiya.
This is our only option.

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.130
Where are you going?

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:27.410
Our battle isn't over yet!

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:28.580
What?!

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:34.120
What's that sound?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.050
There's no way...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.400
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:57.360
Wow! Dragoon has risen
from beneath the rubble!

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:59.090
That's impossible...

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:02.340
Well? Done already?

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:06.260
Why?
Why won't you stay down?

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:07.240
Why?!

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:11.360
Why are you so surprised?
This was bound to happen!

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:13.540
Bound to happen?

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:18.690
Because you haven't been fighting!
You're running from me, too scared to fight!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.680
Running away?!

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:25.160
What are you so afraid of?
I've lost too you know!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.920
Plenty of times!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:35.690
It's embarrassing!
It's pathetic! It's miserable!

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:39.220
But I don't stay down!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:42.400
I get back on my
feet every time!

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:47.960
I fight with all my strength, my moves,
everything I've got! Until I win!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:53.740
That's what makes Beyblade so awesome!
That's why the battles are so exciting!

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:59.250
Do you guys have fun battling like this?
Are you happy winning like this?!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:02.220
Can you proudly call
yourself a Blader?!

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.890
Mihael.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:11.000
How long are you going to listen to his nonsense? Finish him off!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.280
Yes, Coach Barthez!

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:17.560
The demon's howl has
lit the bonfire of hell!

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:23.170
Demon's howl? Yeah, right!
Those are just your Bey's bitter tears!

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:27.010
Your Bey's crying because
you won't fight for real!

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:32.530
Bring it on!
I will never lose to you!

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:37.020
Go, Mihael! For victory!

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.300
That's right...
For victory...

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:42.770
To win with my team...

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:46.820
To win...
To win...!

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:50.080
Can you proudly call
yourself a Blader?!

00:18:55.690 --> 00:19:00.460
Whoa, what happened?
The demon's howl is gone!

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:04.920
What are you doing, Mihael?
Follow my orders! You must!

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:10.880
Here I come, Takao Kinomiya!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:13.440
Yeah! Bring it, Mihael!

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:21.250
Are you trying to destroy our honor and road to domination, Mihael?!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.370
Perfect.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:27.580
Go! Galaxy Storm!

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:36.660
Fire Execution!

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:42.810
--Go!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:46.420
Stop!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:17.720
Dragoon wins!
The BBA pulls off a victory!

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:20.770
The stopped the
Barthez whirlwind!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:26.300
He did it! He did it!

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:34.520
I heard it.
And it was no demon howl.

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:37.730
It was the cry of your
own passionate spirit!

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:41.850
Good luck.

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:52.130
You did it, Takao.

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:53.960
Let's go, Johnny.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:57.720
Yeah. I can't just sit here
after seeing all that!

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:00.340
Just you wait, Takao.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:04.930
We will beat
the BBA for sure!

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:11.480
A Beybattle isn't simply
something you win or lose.

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:15.620
You fight each other, aim for higher
heights, and push your way through!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.960
It's a never-ending
road of battles!

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:21.120
Good work out there, Takao.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:31.780
This is unacceptable!
Absolutely unacceptable!

00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:59.690
The heated world championships move into round four!

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:03.010
Beyblade is popular
here in Egypt as well!

00:23:03.010 --> 00:23:05.570
The kids are having a blast as
they play in the streets!

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:10.410
Naturally, seeing them smile
makes us happy too!

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:13.770
What? Today has
Mihael and Kai?

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:16.570
Everyone's looking happy
now that we're here!

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:21.140
With that good mood in mind,
it's time for the Egyptian stage!
